SELECT cliente_id, nome, cpf FROM lab.clientes WHERE cliente_id = 1
                                      *
ERROR at line 1:
ORA-00942: table or view "LAB"."CLIENTES" does not exist
Help: https://docs.oracle.com/error-help/db/ora-00942/


SQL> SELECT c.uf, COUNT(*) AS pedidos, ROUND(SUM(p.valor_total)) AS faturamento
  2    FROM lab.pedidos p JOIN lab.vw_clientes_analise c ON c.cliente_id = p.cliente_id
  3   WHERE p.data_pedido >= DATE '2025-01-01'
  4   GROUP BY c.uf ORDER BY faturamento DESC;

